Checkpoint.checkpoint_state rho (Checkpoint.written_r0 rho (Arithmetic.original_third_r0 rho))
  (Arithmetic.original_third_final_c rho) (Arithmetic.original_third_final_d rho) (Bridge.first_t3_machine rho)
  (Arithmetic.original_second_t4 rho)
     : forall _ : forall _ : nat, Integers.Int64.int, jet_sx_eval.sstate

